sequenceDiagram
 participant W as Web client
 participant H as HTTP API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant S as WebSocket server
 participant R as Redis
 W->>H: request presence ticket
 H->>DB: validate session and room access
 H-->>W: signed short-lived ticket
 W->>S: upgrade with ticket in Sec-WebSocket-Protocol
 S->>S: validate origin, ticket and room
 S->>DB: check membership and current role
 S->>R: register presence lease
 S-->>W: presence snapshot
 W->>S: commit or ephemeral update
 S->>DB: durable revision check/commit as needed
 S->>R: update live snapshot and schedule flush
 S-->>W: acknowledgement and peer broadcast
 R->>S: pub/sub fanout where configured
